This script is to check that a data list files are all produced so you have merged, flasher and Event cleaning files created
- checkECdata.cpp, checkECdata.h

To compile the script open a container that has root and exact or use ./compile script


to run with the contianer root and exact container
            mnt 
./CheckData y, datalist, eventcleaningfileslocations

to run use the runscripts 

./runscript datalist, eventcleaningfileslocations

                starts from /DataAnalysis                        starts from /event_cleaning/Output
./run_script.sh data_lists/SS_Rank8_20260105_202410toEOY2025.csv sstepanoff3_DataFiles/SS_20260105_2024toEOY2025
